{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302030","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130203001:1":{"text":"물론이죠. 논문 쓰기는 학자에게 기본 중의 기본이에요.","source_cn":"当然，这可是一名学者的基本技能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F329AD773E8F22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130203002:1":{"text":"학자의 지위는 그 사람이 발표한 논문 얼마나 중요한 학술 가치를 지녔는가에 달려있어요.","source_cn":"学者的重要程度取决于他发表论文的重要程度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC66AB7EA395D9371","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130203003:1":{"text":"제가 트라이브 문명을 연구하면 이 분야의 최고 권위자가 되는 거예요!","source_cn":"如果我将这些内容加以研究，那我就会成为蛮血的重要专家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE67A63A263302B44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130203004:1":{"text":"존경받는 트라이브 전문가 레베인... 하하, 상상만 해도 짜릿해요","source_cn":"尊敬的瑞韦恩专家……哈哈，想想都令人激动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2ADDD195CC220E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者瑞韦恩":{"text":"상록수 학자 레베인","source":"冬青学者瑞韦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}